 America settlement marked by terrible stories and secrets of its tormented inhabitants. Understanding each resident’s motivations will be essential to guide your decisions throughout the game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1493640/extras/5f286d2427f68b97417a2876f453f7f6.webp?t=1763044792\" width=616 height=46 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Hunt ghosts as two memorable characters in a story-driven Action-RPG where your decisions carry dramatic consequences. Torn between honoring your oath to the living and saving your departed partner, how far will you go for love?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese, Russian, Korean, Japanese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“An extremely confident RPG with excellent combat, characters, and a lore-rich world to explore”<br>Mirror Gaming<br><br>“Superb writing, excellent performances, a clever central mechanic, and thoughtful, engaging stories”<br>Polygon<br><br>“An accomplished and emotional action adventure”<br>Rock Paper Shotgun<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1493640/header.jpg?t=1763044792", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1493640/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763044792", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1493640/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763044792", "website": "https://community.focus-entmt.com/focus-entertainment/banishers-ghosts-of-new-eden?utm_source=Steam&amp;utm_medium=StorePage_BGONE&amp;utm_campaign=Organic", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit